
* Composites drawn by make_cim_cell.py and make_vext_path.py, wired as generate.py wires one array cell / one column.
.subckt cim_cell d wr wrb x q bus sam samb shr shrb vp vn
Xw d wr wrb q vp vn weight
Xa x q prod vp vn and2
Xc prod bus sam samb shr shrb vp vn sample_cap
.ends

.subckt vext_path vext vsel vg ref sum vpa vp vn
Xls1 vsel vsel_h vsel_hb vpa vp vn ls_hv
Xls2 vg vg_h vg_hb vpa vp vn ls_hv
Xin vext vxi vsel_h vsel_hb vpa vp vn vext_in
Xvr vxi vg_h ref vn nvx
Xvs vn vn sum vn nvx
.ends
